      "message": "fix(post): honor or note end_units across mill posts and gate UI offer\n\nAdd the top-level `endUnits` post manifest contract (`\"<inch> <mm>\"`,\n`\"note\"`, or absent) so every post handles `postOptions.EndUnits`\nconsistently:\n- `fanuc.cps`, `mazak.cps`, `doosan-dnm.cps` (`\"G20 G21\"`) and\n  `sinumerik.cps` (`\"G700 G710\"`) emit the requested unit word right\n  before `M30` / `M2` after the final retract when differing from the\n  program unit (`tormach`, `grblhal`, `tinyg` declare `\"G20 G21\"`).\n- `haas.cps`, `carvera.cps`, and `heidenhain.cps` declare `\"note\"` and\n  emit a one-time `END UNITS NOT WRITTEN ...` note via `note()` when\n  asked for an incompatible/switch end unit.\n- `camcraft_post::post::end_units` refuses undeclared scripts by name\n  before any hook runs when `EndUnits` is set.\n- `posting::end_units_words` drives the Post dialog and `Setup -> Post`\n  picker so only posts declaring unit words offer the combo (labeled\n  with those words), while carried-over non-`Leave` values on unsupported\n  posts get a one-click reset.\n\nFixes #2189\n\nCo-Authored-By: Antigravity <noreply@anthropic.com>",
